		(property "Package" "SX1262_RXEN pulldown. Holds the E22 RF switch in the CLOSE state (TXEN=0, RXEN=0) while the TCA9535 expander ports are high-Z at power-up/reset. Ebyte specifies no pull value; 0,0 = CLOSE is a defined state in the module truth table."
