		(property "LCSC" "C5267441"
			(at 91.44 143.51 0)
			(hide yes)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
		(property "Package" "UFQFPN32 5x5x0.55, 0.5 mm pitch, 32 lands + exposed pad 33. Normal internal RF-regulator mode: VDD_IO on +3V3; VDD and VDD_TX both on NFC_5V_PA_PENDING; I2C_EN grounded to select SPI; VDD_DR sourced from the VDD_RF regulated node - NOT tied to VDD_TX, which would be the regulator-bypass configuration and is not used for Beta. Regulator outputs VDD_D, VDD_A, VDD_RF and VDD_AM plus reference AGDC each carry ST-specified local decoupling. Exposed pad grounded per ST. RF, oscillator and AAT/EXT_LM/CSI pins are on explicit named TBD nets - DO NOT ROUTE until NFC antenna and matching design."
			(at 91.44 143.51 0)
			(hide yes)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
